ance when we report our Q2 results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/gfl-environmental-inc-gfl-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"GFL 2021 Q2","e":"gfl","d":"2021-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Patrick Dovigi","x":"But when you boil that down on a constant currency basis, we're increasing our guidance for revenue and EBITDA by 4% to 5%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/gfl-environmental-inc-gfl-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"GFL 2021 Q2","e":"gfl","d":"2021-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Luke Pelosi","x":"On the strength of the results in the first half of the year, we're increasing our guidance by $100 million to $115 million attributable to solid waste pricing and volume and assuming commodity prices remain at the current levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/gfl-environmental-inc-gfl-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"GFL 2021 Q3","e":"gfl","d":"2021-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Patrick Dovigi","x":"The earlier-than-anticipated closing of tariff years significantly increased liquid waste revenue during the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/gfl-environmental-inc-gfl-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"GFL 2021 Q3","e":"gfl","d":"2021-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick Dovigi","x":"If we don't pick it up, we can't put the price increases, and we're bringing in a lot of churn in that book of business, right?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/gfl-environmental-inc-gfl-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"GFL 2021 Q3","e":"gfl","d":"2021-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick Dovigi","x":"So I think we wouldn't be shy to go back out and put through a PI if we saw the real need to in order to sort of maintain some extraordinary inflation measures that we hadn't predicted when we put through the first price increase earlier in the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/gfl-environmental-inc-gfl-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"GFL 2021 Q3","e":"gfl","d":"2021-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Patrick Dovigi","x":"When you put it all together, the quality of the results for the quarter, combined with our favorable outlook, support us raising our guidance for the second time this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/gfl-environmental-inc-gfl-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"GFL 2021 Q4","e":"gfl","d":"2022-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Luke Pelosi","x":"The price growth was 80 basis points better than Q3, and was supported by a pull-forward of price increase plans in certain U.S. markets to respond to cost inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/10/gfl-environmental-inc-gfl-q4-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"GFL 2021 Q4","e":"gfl","d":"2022-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Walter Spracklin","x":"When a customer gets a big price increase, they may have to take it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/10/gfl-environmental-inc-gfl-q4-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"GFL 2022 Q1","e":"gfl","d":"2022-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Luke Pelosi","x":"Our outperformance on price was a function of higher price increases, better retention and a pull forward of price increases in certain markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/05/gfl-environmental-inc-gfl-q1-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"GFL 2022 Q1","e":"gfl","d":"2022-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Luke Pelosi","x":"We still expect the business to delever by the end of the year, albeit at a tempered pace on account of M&A. Finally, before turning the call back to Patrick for closing remarks, you'll see in our press release that we're raising our guidance for fiscal 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/05/gfl-environmental-inc-gfl-q1-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"GFL 2022 Q2","e":"gfl","d":"2022-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick Dovigi","x":"It's important to remember that this year's price is being achieved even with the delayed impact of the meaningful price increases in our CPI-linked book of business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/28/gfl-environmental-inc-gfl-q2-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"GFL 2022 Q2","e":"gfl","d":"2022-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Luke Pelosi","x":"Variable fuel surcharges recovered just under 50% of the direct fuel price increases we saw this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/28/gfl-environmental-inc-gfl-q2-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"GFL 2022 Q2","e":"gfl","d":"2022-07-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Luke Pelosi","x":"In terms of our outlook, we are increasing our guidance for fiscal 2022 for the second time this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/28/gfl-environmental-inc-gfl-q2-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"GFL 2022 Q2","e":"gfl","d":"2022-07-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Luke Pelosi","x":"The fact that we're able to raise our guidance despite the unprecedented pace of interest rate increases is a testament to the opportunity for free cash flow operating leverage in our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/28/gfl-environmental-inc-gfl-q2-2022-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"GFL 2026 Q2","e":"gfl","d":"2026-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick Dovigi","x":"Is it just the customers are accepting that there is an inflationary environment, fuel is running up, and it's been maybe easier to pass through some pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/gfl-gfl-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GFL 2026 Q2","e":"gfl","d":"2026-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick Dovigi","x":"Maybe you can just talk about what's happening in the industry with some of this positive pricing that you're seeing and your peers are seeing?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/gfl-gfl-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GFL 2026 Q2","e":"gfl","d":"2026-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luke Pelosi","x":"…preventative maintenance, we have AI installations in all of these various sort of things, I'd say it's just sort of early days and where I take great comfort is if you extrapolate what the margin and cost savings implications of some of those applications could be, they're very large numbers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/gfl-gfl-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GFL 2026 Q2","e":"gfl","d":"2026-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Luke Pelosi","x":"Based on the strength of the first half and our positive outlook for the remainder of the year, we are pleased to be able to increase our guidance top to bottom for the second time this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/gfl-gfl-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GFL 2026 Q2","e":"gfl","d":"2026-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick Dovigi","x":"Moreover, the quality of our first half results allows us to raise our full year guidance for the second time this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/gfl-gfl-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GFL 2026 Q3","e":"gfl","d":"2026-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick Dovigi","x":"I think just given what's happened in the Middle East and some of that tension, and what's happened obviously with the U.S. and tariffs and the Canadian government now looking to sort of focus inward versus outward, that is driving incremental opportunity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/gfl-gfl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GFL 2026 Q3","e":"gfl","d":"2026-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Luke Pelosi","x":"At the beginning of the third quarter, the restructuring of a large multifaceted recycling contract in Western Canada removed our obligation to provide brokered transportation services on a pass-through basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/gfl-gfl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GFL 2026 Q3","e":"gfl","d":"2026-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Luke Pelosi","x":"We used to have a meaningful transportation component whereby we were coordinating third-party transport and effectively just passing that through, being a broker on that piece.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/gfl-gfl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GFL 2026 Q3","e":"gfl","d":"2026-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luke Pelosi","x":"As part of the restructuring the contract, we are no longer doing that component of it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/gfl-gfl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GFL 2026 Q3","e":"gfl","d":"2026-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Luke Pelosi","x":"With the closing of SECURE and the ongoing quality of our financial performance, we are once again increasing our guidance for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/gfl-gfl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GFL 2026 Q3","e":"gfl","d":"2026-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick Dovigi","x":"The ongoing quality and durability of our operational performance, coupled with the closing of SECURE, allows us to raise our guidance for the third time this year and provides for an extremely compelling set-up for 2027 and beyond.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/gfl-gfl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[45,1,9311,0,0,0,7662,1278],[46,1,12351,0,0,0,9694,2179],[47,1,10934,0,0,0,83